    "updated_at": "2016-04-27T13:55:43Z",
    "body": "I suspect the submit event needs to be scoped. That's not done yet. Not sure about other form-specific events...\n\nSeems submit is not mentioned by https://w3c.github.io/webcomponents/spec/shadow/#scoped-flag but that's probably a bug.\n\n@hayatoito, @smaug----, thoughts?\n",
