    "updated_at": "2016-04-27T14:07:51Z",
    "body": "It probably should indeed. Otherwise the light DOM may get odd submit events which aren't coming from any form. Same with reset.\n\nNot sure about other events like input/change, since  one could implement a new form-widget-like element using shadow DOM and such element might be used outside any form, just like <input> and such.\n",
